# Dashboard Rules

- TypeScript only; format/lint with Biome.
- Data access via Drizzle server routes / server components — not Control Plane REST for CRUD reads.
- Do not put OPA/policy decision logic in React components; use `src/lib` helpers if needed.
- Never return full `webhookSecret` in list APIs; generate secrets with Node `crypto`, not `Math.random()`.
- Prefer `catch (error: unknown)`; no empty catches.
- Exclude `.next` from Biome checks.
